      "source": "docs/chapters/10-07-lesson.md:17",
      "judgment": "JSON object/array/string/bool與Rust欄位對應先教；數字文字不同、i32範圍、無註解/尾逗號與escape敘述準確。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/10-07-lesson.md:31",
      "judgment": "Serialize/Deserialize<'a>與serde_json格式職責、serde derive feature、deny_unknown_fields的明確拒絕政策在首model source前；String/Vec/bool必要traits及Debug/PartialEq條件完整。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/10-07-lesson.md:62",
      "judgment": "from_str::<Notebook>借&str依Deserialize<'a>，不要求FromStr；to_string_pretty借模型依Serialize回owned String；與cached serde_json1.0.154精確簽名一致。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/10-07-lesson.md:67",
      "judgment": "trait lifetime參數連來源不強制結果保存reference；Notebook無reference，原輸入String結束後仍可用。圖對文字→owned模型→新owned文字的表示分清，不宣稱恢復原排版。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/10-07-lesson.md:158",
      "judgment": "NotebookError只有Debug/Display與兩份From，完整io::Error沒有硬加PartialEq；兩個?分別封裝Io/Json。InvalidUTF8在read_to_string先成Io/InvalidData，不會進JSON。沒有需要未教std::error::Error。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/10-07-lesson.md:188",
      "judgment": "file_errors test載3codec+1json_files；完整codec和json_files tests均在頁中提供，source只用已教API和資料；basic_json run正常不載cfg test body及json_files。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/10-07-lesson.md:224",
      "judgment": "archive答案只改archived，encode失敗透過已有From轉NotebookError；重新decode逐欄/位置驗證title、80/120與true，而非只搜尋輸出字串。"
    }
